dogs"). We merge them to create a new token, "do." Although "og" also appea=
rs 10 times, "do" comes first alphabetically. The token "do" is added to th=
e vocabulary, and the frequency counts are updated. "do" now occurs 10 time=
s, and the individual counts of "d" and "o" are reduced accordingly.</p>
