nents</figcaption></div></figure>
<p>The encoder consists of the following components:</p>
<ul>
<li>Text embedding</li>
<li>Positional encoding</li>
<li>Transformer</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Text embedding:</strong> This component converts each input toke=
n into an embedding vector. These embeddings capture the semantic informati=
on of each token.</p>
