<h5 id=3D"ml-objective-and-loss-function-1">ML objective and loss function<=
/h5>
<p>Whereas the pretraining stage was unsupervised, the finetuning stage is =
supervised. The encoder processes source sentence tokens for each training =
example, and the decoder generates the target sentence tokens. Since the de=
coder should generate tokens sequentially after training, we use next-token=
 prediction as our ML objective. We use cross-entropy as our loss function =
to measure the accuracy of the predicted next token.</p>
